<div class="policy-page">
  <div class="policy-inner">
    <h1 class="policy-title">Payment Methods</h1>
    <p class="policy-date">We offer a variety of secure and convenient payment options for your shopping experience at Nichey.</p>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>💳 Visa & Mastercard</h2>
      <p>Pay securely with your Visa or Mastercard credit or debit card. All transactions are encrypted with SSL technology to ensure your card details are always protected.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>🅿️ PayPal</h2>
      <p>Use your PayPal account for a fast and secure checkout experience. PayPal offers buyer protection on all eligible purchases made through our store.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>🍎 Apple Pay</h2>
      <p>Shop quickly and securely using Apple Pay on your iPhone, iPad, or Mac. No need to enter your card details — just authenticate with Face ID or Touch ID.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>G Google Pay</h2>
      <p>Pay with Google Pay using your saved cards in your Google account. Fast, simple, and secure checkout on any Android device or Chrome browser.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>🏦 American Express</h2>
      <p>We proudly accept American Express cards. Enjoy the same secure and seamless checkout experience with your Amex credit or charge card.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>🛵 COD — Cash on Delivery</h2>
      <p>Prefer to pay in cash? We offer Cash on Delivery across the UAE. Simply place your order and pay when it arrives at your doorstep. COD is available for orders up to AED 2,000.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>🟣 Tabby — Buy Now, Pay Later</h2>
      <p>Split your purchase into 4 interest-free payments with Tabby. Available for orders between AED 0 and AED 10,000. No hidden fees, no interest. Select Tabby at checkout to get started.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>🟢 Tamara — Buy Now, Pay Later</h2>
      <p>Shop now and pay later with Tamara. Split your order into 2 or 3 easy installments with zero interest. Available to UAE residents with a valid mobile number and ID.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>🔒 Payment Security</h2>
      <p>All payments on Nichey are processed through secure, encrypted gateways. We do not store your card information on our servers. Your financial data is always safe with us.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>❓ Need Help?</h2>
      <p>If you experience any issues with payment, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@nichey.store">hello@nichey.store</a> or call <a href="tel:+971XXXXXXXXX">+971 XX XXX XXXX</a> and our team will assist you immediately.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<style>
.policy-page { background: #fff; padding: 60px 20px 80px; }
.policy-inner { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; }
.policy-title { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 0 0 8px; }
.policy-date { font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin: 0 0 48px; line-height: 1.7; }
.policy-section { padding: 28px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #efefef; }
.policy-section:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.policy-section h2 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 0 0 10px; }
.policy-section p { font-size: 14px; color: #555; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0; }
.policy-section a { color: #1a1a1a; text-decoration: underline; }
@media(max-width: 600px) {
  .policy-title { font-size: 26px; }
  .policy-page { padding: 36px 16px 60px; }
}
</style>

